(7510513, 1198552, 83313, '<td valign="top">There is a LOT of pixelation visible in this pic. I wasn''t sure if it was an intentional effect or not, so I had a look at the image size. 159k is a reasonable file size for a monochrome image of this size, but, it also appears to be suffering from the effects of extreme JPEG compression. Always use the least compression you can and still fit the image into the challenge limits. If that is an intentional effect, (perhaps you were shooting through a fabric?) then I misinterpreted what I saw.</td>', 'There is a LOT of pixelation visible in this pic. I wasn''t sure if it was an intentional effect or not, so I had a look at the image size. 159k is a reasonable file size for a monochrome image of this size, but, it also appears to be suffering from the effects of extreme JPEG compression. Always use the least compression you can and still fit the image into the challenge limits. If that is an intentional effect, (perhaps you were shooting through a fabric?) then I misinterpreted what I saw.', '2017-04-23 23:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
